<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="vi">

<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
  <title>Hóa Đơn Booking - Major Guide</title>
  <style>
    @import url('https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@400;500;600;700;800&display=swap');

    * {
      margin: 0;
      padding: 0;
      box-sizing: border-box;
    }

    body {
      font-family: 'Inter', 'Segoe UI', sans-serif;
      background: #f0f4f8;
      color: #1a202c;
      padding: 32px 24px;
      min-height: 100vh;
    }

    .wrapper {
      max-width: 700px;
      margin: 0 auto;
    }

    /* ── WARNING BANNER ── */
    .warning-banner {
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, #ff6b35 0%, #f7931e 100%);
      border-radius: 12px;
      padding: 16px 20px;
      margin-bottom: 24px;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 14px;
      box-shadow: 0 4px 20px rgba(255, 107, 53, 0.35);
    }

    .warning-icon {
      font-size: 28px;
      flex-shrink: 0;
    }

    .warning-text {
      color: #fff;
    }

    .warning-text strong {
      display: block;
      font-size: 15px;
      font-weight: 700;
      margin-bottom: 2px;
      letter-spacing: 0.3px;
    }

    .warning-text span {
      font-size: 13px;
      opacity: 0.92;
    }

    .countdown-badge {
      margin-left: auto;
      background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.25);
      border: 2px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.6);
      border-radius: 50px;
      padding: 6px 16px;
      color: #fff;
      font-weight: 700;
      font-size: 14px;
      white-space: nowrap;
      flex-shrink: 0;
    }

    /* ── INVOICE CARD ── */
    .invoice-card {
      background: #ffffff;
      border-radius: 20px;
      overflow: hidden;
      box-shadow: 0 8px 40px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.10);
    }

    /* ── HEADER ── */
    .invoice-header {
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, #667eea 0%, #764ba2 100%);
      padding: 32px 36px 28px;
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      align-items: flex-start;
    }

    .brand {
      color: #fff;
    }

    .brand-name {
      font-size: 22px;
      font-weight: 800;
      letter-spacing: -0.5px;
    }

    .brand-tagline {
      font-size: 12px;
      opacity: 0.78;
      margin-top: 3px;
      font-weight: 400;
    }

    .invoice-meta {
      text-align: right;
      color: #fff;
    }

    .invoice-label {
      font-size: 28px;
      font-weight: 800;
      letter-spacing: -1px;
      opacity: 0.95;
    }

    .invoice-number {
      font-size: 12px;
      opacity: 0.7;
      margin-top: 4px;
    }

    .invoice-status {
      display: inline-block;
      background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.22);
      border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.45);
      border-radius: 50px;
      padding: 3px 12px;
      font-size: 11px;
      font-weight: 600;
      margin-top: 6px;
      letter-spacing: 0.5px;
    }

    /* ── BODY ── */
    .invoice-body {
      padding: 32px 36px;
    }

    /* ── CUSTOMER INFO ── */
    .section-title {
      font-size: 11px;
      font-weight: 700;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      letter-spacing: 1.2px;
      color: #8896a8;
      margin-bottom: 12px;
    }

    .info-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
      gap: 12px;
      margin-bottom: 28px;
    }

    .info-item {
      background: #f7f9fc;
      border-radius: 10px;
      padding: 12px 16px;
      border: 1px solid #e8ecf2;
    }

    .info-item-label {
      font-size: 11px;
      color: #8896a8;
      font-weight: 600;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      letter-spacing: 0.8px;
      margin-bottom: 4px;
    }

    .info-item-value {
      font-size: 14px;
      color: #1a202c;
      font-weight: 600;
    }

    .info-item-value.email {
      font-weight: 400;
      color: #667eea;
      font-size: 13px;
    }

    /* ── DIVIDER ── */
    .divider {
      border: none;
      border-top: 1px solid #e8ecf2;
      margin: 0 0 28px;
    }

    /* ── EXPERT CARD ── */
    .expert-card {
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, #f0f4ff 0%, #f7f0ff 100%);
      border: 1px solid #d6def8;
      border-radius: 14px;
      padding: 20px 22px;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 18px;
      margin-bottom: 28px;
    }

    .expert-avatar {
      width: 68px;
      height: 68px;
      border-radius: 50%;
      object-fit: cover;
      border: 3px solid #667eea;
      flex-shrink: 0;
    }

    .expert-avatar-placeholder {
      width: 68px;
      height: 68px;
      border-radius: 50%;
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, #667eea, #764ba2);
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      color: #fff;
      font-size: 26px;
      font-weight: 700;
      flex-shrink: 0;
      border: 3px solid #667eea;
    }

    .expert-info {
      flex: 1;
    }

    .expert-role {
      font-size: 11px;
      font-weight: 700;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      letter-spacing: 1px;
      color: #667eea;
      margin-bottom: 4px;
    }

    .expert-name {
      font-size: 18px;
      font-weight: 700;
      color: #1a202c;
      margin-bottom: 2px;
    }

    .expert-badge {
      display: inline-block;
      background: #667eea;
      color: #fff;
      font-size: 10px;
      font-weight: 600;
      padding: 2px 10px;
      border-radius: 50px;
      letter-spacing: 0.5px;
    }

    /* ── SCHEDULE TABLE ── */
    .schedule-table {
      width: 100%;
      border-collapse: separate;
      border-spacing: 0;
      margin-bottom: 28px;
      border-radius: 12px;
      overflow: hidden;
      border: 1px solid #e8ecf2;
    }

    .schedule-table thead tr {
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, #667eea 0%, #764ba2 100%);
    }

    .schedule-table th {
      color: #fff;
      font-size: 12px;
      font-weight: 600;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      letter-spacing: 0.8px;
      padding: 13px 18px;
      text-align: left;
    }

    .schedule-table td {
      padding: 13px 18px;
      font-size: 14px;
      color: #334155;
      border-bottom: 1px solid #e8ecf2;
      background: #fff;
      font-weight: 500;
    }

    .schedule-table tbody tr:last-child td {
      border-bottom: none;
    }

    .schedule-table tbody tr:nth-child(even) td {
      background: #f7f9fc;
    }

    .time-chip {
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 5px;
      background: #ede9fe;
      color: #5b21b6;
      font-size: 13px;
      font-weight: 600;
      padding: 3px 12px;
      border-radius: 50px;
    }

    /* ── TOTAL SECTION ── */
    .totals-section {
      background: #f7f9fc;
      border: 1px solid #e8ecf2;
      border-radius: 14px;
      padding: 22px 24px;
      margin-bottom: 28px;
    }

    .total-row {
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      align-items: center;
      padding: 8px 0;
      font-size: 14px;
      color: #64748b;
      border-bottom: 1px dashed #e2e8f0;
    }

    .total-row:last-child {
      border-bottom: none;
      padding-top: 14px;
      margin-top: 6px;
    }

    .total-row.grand {
      font-size: 18px;
      font-weight: 800;
      color: #1a202c;
    }

    .total-row.grand .amount {
      color: #667eea;
      font-size: 22px;
    }

    .total-row .label {
      font-weight: 500;
    }

    .total-row .amount {
      font-weight: 600;
    }

    /* ── PAYMENT WARNING BOX ── */
    .payment-warning-box {
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, #fff7ed 0%, #fff3e6 100%);
      border: 2px solid #fdba74;
      border-radius: 14px;
      padding: 18px 22px;
      margin-bottom: 28px;
      display: flex;
      gap: 14px;
      align-items: flex-start;
    }

    .payment-warning-box .pw-icon {
      font-size: 26px;
      flex-shrink: 0;
      margin-top: 1px;
    }

    .payment-warning-box .pw-content strong {
      display: block;
      color: #c2410c;
      font-size: 14px;
      font-weight: 700;
      margin-bottom: 5px;
    }

    .payment-warning-box .pw-content p {
      color: #92400e;
      font-size: 13px;
      line-height: 1.6;
    }

    /* ── FOOTER ── */
    .invoice-footer {
      background: #f7f9fc;
      border-top: 1px solid #e8ecf2;
      padding: 20px 36px;
      text-align: center;
    }

    .footer-text {
      font-size: 12px;
      color: #94a3b8;
      line-height: 1.7;
    }

    .footer-brand {
      font-weight: 700;
      color: #667eea;
    }
  </style>
</head>

<body>
  <div class="wrapper">

    <!-- ── TOP WARNING BANNER ── -->
    <div class="warning-banner">
      <div class="warning-icon">⏰</div>
      <div class="warning-text">
        <strong>Vui lòng thanh toán trong vòng 30 phút!</strong>
        <span>Đặt lịch của bạn sẽ tự động bị huỷ nếu không thanh toán kịp thời.</span>
      </div>
      <div class="countdown-badge">⏳ 30:00</div>
    </div>

    <div class="invoice-card">

      <!-- ── HEADER ── -->
      <div class="invoice-header">
        <div class="brand">
          <div class="brand-name">🎓 Major Guide</div>
          <div class="brand-tagline">Nền tảng kết nối chuyên gia</div>
        </div>
        <div class="invoice-meta">
          <div class="invoice-label">HÓA ĐƠN</div>
          <div class="invoice-number">Booking Confirmation</div>
          <div class="invoice-status">⏳ CHỜ THANH TOÁN</div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- ── BODY ── -->
      <div class="invoice-body">

        <!-- CUSTOMER INFO -->
        <div class="section-title">Thông tin khách hàng</div>
        <div class="info-grid">
          <div class="info-item">
            <div class="info-item-label">Họ và tên</div>
            <div class="info-item-value"><%= nameCustomer %></div>
          </div>
          <div class="info-item">
            <div class="info-item-label">Email</div>
            <div class="info-item-value email"><%= email %></div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <hr class="divider" />

        <!-- EXPERT INFO -->
        <div class="section-title">Chuyên gia được chọn</div>
        <div class="expert-card">
          <% if (avartarExpert && avartarExpert.trim() !== '') { %>
            <img class="expert-avatar" src="<%= avartarExpert %>" alt="Avatar chuyên gia" />
          <% } else { %>
            <div class="expert-avatar-placeholder"><%= nameExpert ? nameExpert.charAt(0).toUpperCase() : 'E' %></div>
          <% } %>
          <div class="expert-info">
            <div class="expert-role">Chuyên gia tư vấn</div>
            <div class="expert-name"><%= nameExpert %></div>
            <span class="expert-badge">✔ Đã xác minh</span>
          </div>
        </div>

        <hr class="divider" />

        <!-- SCHEDULE DETAILS -->
        <div class="section-title">Chi tiết lịch hẹn</div>
        <table class="schedule-table">
          <thead>
            <tr>
              <th>Thông tin</th>
              <th>Giá trị</th>
            </tr>
          </thead>
          <tbody>
            <tr>
              <td>📅 Ngày hỗ trợ</td>
              <td>
                <%
                  var dayStr = '';
                  try {
                    var d = new Date(daySupport);
                    dayStr = d.toLocaleDateString('vi-VN', { weekday: 'long', year: 'numeric', month: '2-digit', day: '2-digit' });
                  } catch(e) { dayStr = String(daySupport); }
                %>
                <%= dayStr %>
              </td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td>🕐 Giờ bắt đầu</td>
              <td>
                <span class="time-chip">
                  ▶
                  <%
                    var startStr = '';
                    try {
                      var s = new Date(startTime);
                      startStr = s.toLocaleTimeString('vi-VN', { hour: '2-digit', minute: '2-digit' });
                    } catch(e) { startStr = String(startTime); }
                  %>
                  <%= startStr %>
                </span>
              </td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td>🕕 Giờ kết thúc</td>
              <td>
                <span class="time-chip">
                  ⏹
                  <%
                    var endStr = '';
                    try {
                      var e = new Date(endTime);
                      endStr = e.toLocaleTimeString('vi-VN', { hour: '2-digit', minute: '2-digit' });
                    } catch(e2) { endStr = String(endTime); }
                  %>
                  <%= endStr %>
                </span>
              </td>
            </tr>
          </tbody>
        </table>

        <!-- TOTAL -->
        <div class="totals-section">
          <div class="total-row">
            <span class="label">Phí tư vấn (1 buổi)</span>
            <span class="amount">
              <%
                var formatted = '';
                try {
                  formatted = Number(priceTotal).toLocaleString('vi-VN') + ' đ';
                } catch(e) { formatted = priceTotal + ' đ'; }
              %>
              <%= formatted %>
            </span>
          </div>
          <div class="total-row">
            <span class="label">Phí dịch vụ nền tảng</span>
            <span class="amount">Miễn phí</span>
          </div>
          <div class="total-row grand">
            <span class="label">Tổng thanh toán</span>
            <span class="amount"><%= formatted %></span>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- PAYMENT WARNING BOX -->
        <div class="payment-warning-box">
          <div class="pw-icon">⚠️</div>
          <div class="pw-content">
            <strong>Lưu ý quan trọng về thanh toán</strong>
            <p>
              Bạn cần hoàn tất thanh toán <strong>trong vòng 30 phút</strong> kể từ khi nhận được hóa đơn này.
              Sau thời gian trên, lịch hẹn sẽ <strong>tự động bị huỷ</strong> và slot sẽ được mở lại cho người dùng khác.
              Vui lòng không đóng tab này cho đến khi thanh toán thành công.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>

      </div>
      <!-- end invoice-body -->

      <!-- ── FOOTER ── -->
      <div class="invoice-footer">
        <p class="footer-text">
          Cảm ơn bạn đã tin tưởng sử dụng <span class="footer-brand">Major Guide</span>.<br />
          Mọi thắc mắc vui lòng liên hệ hỗ trợ qua email:
          <span class="footer-brand"><%= email %></span><br />
          © <%= new Date().getFullYear() %> Major Guide. All rights reserved.
        </p>
      </div>

    </div>
    <!-- end invoice-card -->

  </div>
</body>

</html>